# ── EOL 归一化基线（hooks kit 铺入；仓内特化规则追加于本文件下方）──
# * text=auto : git 按内容判文本/二进制，文本入 index 统一 LF——
#               归一化契约住在仓内，不依赖各机 core.autocrlf 配置漂移
# * eol=lf    : 检出恒 LF——Windows/POSIX 工作区同型，工具写 CRLF 经
#               add 归一化消化（不产生"整文件换行"伪 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 原生例外：cmd.exe 标签/goto 解析对行尾字节敏感
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# POSIX 入口强制 LF——`#!/usr/bin/env bash\r` 的 shebang 失效类
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 常见二进制钉（防 auto 误判；仓内特化类型追加于下）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.jar binary
*.wasm binary
*.whl binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.pyd binary
*.dat binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
